{"completed": true, "response": "那种熟悉的温柔又出现了，和对方亲近让他感到满足，这种满足是真实的。因为他渐渐开始在乎这份亲近，所以现在的开心比以前更有分量。他还是担心这份亲近会不会挤占自己的空间，所以心里有一点顾虑，但这并没有盖过他的满足。他还没有要求对方回应，也没有寻求保证，更没有去想未来会怎样，只是更加认真地感受着当下已经拥有的亲近。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a2e88b6e-1315-4ce9-a9ff-9d561c788787", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003220942916Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:32:27.385986+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c98406d21e05a3fe76c6d51a1f1779bd308559da44b8c2cb04fc7d820f1c81b2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003220942916Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "